      "text": "Reading Practice: A day at a Japanese restaurant.",
      "sequence_id": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. Jones goes to a restaurant in Tokyo for lunch.",
      "sequence_id": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "He looks at another table and sees a dish he does not know.",
      "sequence_id": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "He points to it and asks the waitress, \"Are wa nan desu ka?\" (What is that?).",
      "sequence_id": 4
